<title>Markdown</title>

CSCode can be used to edit and view <link CSPro::markdown_overview.csdoc>Markdown</link> files.

<subheader>Default Extensions</subheader>

.md

<subheader>Run Menu</subheader>

<list>
    <li>Run (<b>Ctrl + R</b>): View the Markdown, rendered as HTML using <link "https://github.com/sindresorhus/github-markdown-css">GitHub's style conventions</link>, in the HTML Viewer.</li>
    <li>Save as HTML: Save the Markdown as a HTML file.</li>
</list>
